 "_comment": "District state catalog (GDD 14.2). A state is data: art suffix + rule modifiers. Used now (Phase 7, GREY only): danger_delta (creatures stronger per point, balance.json/events), shop_price_mult, infirmary_mult, shift_pay_mult, contract_reward_mult (new leaflets), rumor_bonus (more diamonds each morning and room for them), closed_actions (place actions shut while the state lasts), overlay (the district map look). ring_growth_mult, monster_pool_add, rumor_tag_weights wait for their mechanics.",
